Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.57,0:14:22.89,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇暴！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.57,0:14:30.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們是什麼來頭
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.08,0:14:32.99,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,趁現在 快去安全的地方！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.85,0:14:35.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 好的...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.67,0:14:37.41,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,這裡哪有安全的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.32,0:14:40.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.12,0:14:42.13,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.89,0:14:44.35,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.05,0:14:48.31,CureSky,NTP,0,0,0,,糟糕！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.25,0:14:52.29,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,Sky！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.85,0:14:57.84,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,呀！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.18,0:15:05.33,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.92,0:15:08.62,CurePri,NTP,0,0,0,,啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.79,0:15:09.79,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,Prism！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.48,0:15:19.65,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇兇
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.58,0:15:22.27,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.37,0:15:25.71,CureMaj,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.80,0:15:28.95,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.85,0:15:35.51,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇暴獸的藤蔓連接著這島上的所有藤蔓
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.97,0:15:37.65,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你們無處可逃
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.60,0:15:42.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們幾個
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.15,0:15:47.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晴朗寶石交給你們了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.18,0:15:50.13,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,你在說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.52,0:15:52.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們已經無法飛行了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.33,0:15:58.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使能夠飛行 除了這座島 我們也沒有別的地方能去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.54,0:16:00.85,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,沒有這回事！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.24,0:16:06.45,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,被人懼怕 只是祖上傳下來的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.47,0:16:10.49,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,各位並沒有見過藍天大地的人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.14,0:16:15.45,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,不敢保證就沒有人會害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.97,0:16:19.96,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 肯定會有像我們這樣 能夠接納你們的人！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.04,0:16:29.42,CureBut,NTP,0,0,0,,喝！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.13,0:16:35.01,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,風曳樹的葉子... 有了！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.42,0:16:37.43,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,各位！用那個！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.20,0:16:40.33,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,把那些葉子當作飛羽 飛吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.78,0:16:42.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飛...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.57,0:16:45.22,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,我來吸引注意力！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.48,0:16:47.59,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,趁這個機會！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.26,0:16:49.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可... 可是...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.33,0:16:54.00,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,飛出島外吧！邁出這第一步！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.46,0:17:05.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喔... 飛得那麼高...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.69,0:17:08.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.08,0:17:15.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙！抓住葉子！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.98,0:17:20.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們飛起來了！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.72,0:17:23.81,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,只要繼續飛行...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.48,0:17:26.20,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,無用功
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.76,0:17:34.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.26,0:17:41.66,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,僵持下去的話...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.46,0:17:49.11,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,飛出島外吧！邁出這第一步！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.38,0:17:53.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.63,0:17:58.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.34,0:18:02.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飛起來了！用我自己的飛羽！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.05,0:18:17.41,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,有了...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.98,0:18:23.39,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,你們無處可逃 能追到你們天涯海角
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.41,0:18:27.66,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,那我就發揮你的這種特性！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.27,0:18:39.15,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇暴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.75,0:18:42.90,DarkBnd,NTP,0,0,0,,兇... 兇暴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.70,0:18:46.67,CureWin,NTP,0,0,0,,大伙！
